   "intent": "Ominous intro. Bars 1-3: low D drone + choir, orchestral hits ONLY on the 5 kinetic words. Bars 4-6: pizzicato 8th ostinato + low strings, ticking tension. Bars 7-8: build, snare roll, rising strings, riser into drop."
  },
  {
   "name": "reveal",
   "start": 16.0,
   "end": 32.0,
   "bars": [
    9,
    16
   ],
   "intent": "DROP A. Full heroic theme on horns+strings, taiko groove, 16th string ostinato, choir. The product appears."
  },
  {
   "name": "feat1",
   "start": 32.0,
   "end": 48.0,
   "bars": [
    17,
    24
   ],
   "intent": "Feature groove A (Crafting): lighter, leaves room for voice. Lute/harp arpeggios, string ostinato, frame drum groove, flute counter-line. Forge feel (anvil-like accents)."
  },
  {
   "name": "feat2",
   "start": 48.0,
   "end": 64.0,
   "bars": [
    25,
    32
   ],
   "intent": "Feature groove B (Black Market): darker colour, low brass stabs, staccato strings, same tempo/energy."
  },
  {
   "name": "feat3",
   "start": 64.0,
   "end": 80.0,
   "bars": [
    33,
    40
   ],
   "intent": "Feature groove C (Item prices): brighter, adventurous jig-like fiddle/flute melody over the groove, tambourine."
  },
  {
   "name": "montage",
   "start": 80.0,
   "end": 88.0,
   "bars": [
    41,
    44
   ],
   "intent": "Montage: full intensity, an accent hit every bar (cuts land every beat 1 and 3)."
  },
  {
   "name": "breakdown",
   "start": 88.0,
   "end": 96.0,
   "bars": [
    45,
    48
   ],
   "intent": "Breakdown: drums out, choir + strings pad, heartbeat timpani, tension rising."
  },
  {
   "name": "metric",
   "start": 96.0,
   "end": 104.0,
   "bars": [
    49,
    52
   ],
   "intent": "Metric: massive hit on bar 49 beat 1 (the number lands), then strings tremolo build, snare roll bars 51-52 into final chorus."
  },
  {
   "name": "finale",
   "start": 104.0,
   "end": 116.0,
   "bars": [
    53,
    58
   ],
   "intent": "Final chorus: full theme, triumphant, brass + choir, biggest energy. Logo lockup + CTA."
