 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 6.1,
   "text": "Seven cities. One Black Market."
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 9.0,
   "text": "Thousands of prices, and all of them moving."
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 12.6,
   "text": "Guess wrong, and the forge eats your profit."
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 16.75,
   "text": "This is Albion Journal."
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 19.9,
   "text": "Live Europe prices from the Albion Online Data Project, with tax, resource return and the station fee already inside."
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 28.6,
   "text": "Free. No sign-up. No ads."
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 32.6,
   "text": "Open Crafting, and every recipe is costed, city by city."
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 37.4,
   "text": "Pick a category, sort by profit, and the best thing to make today rises to the top."
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 43.2,
   "text": "Open any row. Unit cost, the sweet spot, a full batch. Already worked out."
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 48.6,
   "text": "Rather flip than craft? Buy in any city, and sell to the Black Market."
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 54.4,
   "text": "Every row tells you where to buy, which quality, and what you keep after tax."
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 64.6,
   "text": "Need one price, fast? Type a few letters."
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "t": 69.6,
   "text": "Master's Cape. All seven cities and the Black Market, at a glance."
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "t": 75.6,
   "text": "No spreadsheets. No guesswork."
  },
  {
   "id": "v15",
   "t": 80.3,
   "text": "Refining. Enchanting. Potions and food. Your island. Even the roads to Caerleon."
  },
  {
   "id": "v16",
   "t": 88.6,
   "text": "And the market never sleeps."
  },
  {
   "id": "v17",
   "t": 96.6,
   "text": "Six thousand, nine hundred and eighty-five items. Updated in seconds."
  },
  {
